              "id": "source",
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "export function clamp(value,min,max) { return Math.min(min,Math.max(max,value)); }\n"
            },
            {
              "id": "plan",
              "kind": "text",
              "value": "Defect: min/max swapped — `Math.min(min, ...)` never exceeds min, and `Math.max(max, value)` never drops below max, so the result is always min (for min<=max).\n\nFix: `return Math.min(max, Math.max(min, value));`\n\nEdge cases: value equal to min or max returns unchanged (inclusive); NaN input propagates NaN; min>max is unspecified—consider throwing or asserting."
            }
          ],
